@startuml
actor "Invited Person" as Person
participant "Nexo" as System
Person -> System: Create account (email, name, password)
System -> System: Check the email is registered to an organization and has no account yet
alt Email eligible and available
    System --> Person: Member account created and signed in
else Email not eligible or already has an account
    System --> Person: Account creation rejected (not eligible or conflict error)
end
@enduml
